  "description": "YITAMOTOR tail lamps with turn signal & running light tell you that it's ready for excursions. This pair of seamless taillamps are direct-fit replacements & upgrades for your old or damaged taillights, burning brighter and lasting longer to keep you safe and give your vehicle a dramatic look.\nFitment\n1999-2006 Chevy Silverado 1500/2500\n2001-2006 Chevy Silverado 1500HD/2500HD/3500\n2007 Chevy Silverado Classic\n1999-2002 GMC Sierra 1500/2500\n2001-2002 GMC Sierra 1500HD/2500HD/3500\nDo not fit Barn Door or Stepside models\nNote: This Tail Light Fits Fleetside Models Only\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\n1. Direct OEM Fit\nDesigned to be an exact replacement for your factory-installed tail lights.\n2. Superior Illumination\nBulbs are not included (reuse the stock bulbs instead). Sold in pairs with black smoke lenses and high-intensity lamps provide exceptional illumination for increased driving safety.\n3. Tougher-Than-Nails Construction\nHeavy-duty housings are made of superior OEM Grade ABS plastic to ensure exceptional weather and impact resistance so they will serve you for years ahead.\n4. Simple Plug and Play Installation\nThese bolt-on style tail lights are designed for quick and easy installation. There's no need for any modifications, they drop right into the factory location.",
